/* Tools.swift */
"用 macOS 自带的文字识别读图片（PNG、JPEG、HEIC、TIFF 等）或 PDF 里的字，全在本机、不联网。\n自动处理：任意角度的旋转（倒着的也行）；大图里的小字（自动切块细认，接缝处切开的长行会拼回去）；表格、多栏、竖排（macOS 26 起走「认文档」，表格输出成 Markdown）；手机照片的方向标记。\n装了判定插件时还会：先看图决定怎么认、自动拉正拍歪的纸、复核可疑的行。没装插件时只在要认文档且纸明显歪了时才拉正，拍歪的照片可以传 rectify=on。\n认不了或认不准：表情符号（直接丢）、公式里的上下标、字高不到约 8 像素的字、印章那种沿弧线排的字、真手写（没测过）。\nPDF 里有文字（Word、浏览器导出的）时直接用它的字，一字不差、快得多，插图另外认；扫描件、扫描件上别的软件加的隐形文字层照常认图。\n可能认错的行会在结果末尾单独列出，正文里原样保留、没有删。\n一次回复有大小上限：多页 PDF 放不下时只给前几页，末尾写明没给的页接着用什么 pages 参数；要整份全文用 ocr_to_file。" = "Reads the text in images (PNG, JPEG, HEIC, TIFF, and more) or PDFs with macOS’s built-in text recognition, entirely on this Mac with no network access.\nHandled automatically: rotation at any angle (even upside down); small text in large images (split into tiles automatically for a closer look, and long lines cut at tile seams are joined back together); tables, multiple columns, and vertical text (from macOS 26 on, these go through document mode, and tables are output as Markdown); the orientation tag on phone photos.\nWith a judgment plugin installed, it also checks the image first to decide how to recognize it, automatically straightens pages photographed at an angle, and reviews suspicious lines. Without plugins, it straightens a page only when recognizing in document mode and the page is clearly tilted; for a photo taken at an angle, pass rectify=on.\nCan’t recognize, or recognizes poorly: emoji (dropped), superscripts and subscripts in formulas, text under about 8 pixels tall, text set along an arc as on seals, real handwriting (untested).\nWhen a PDF contains text (exported from Word or a browser), that text is used directly: exact and much faster, with illustrations recognized separately. Scans, and invisible text layers that other software added to scans, are recognized from the image as usual.\nLines that may be misrecognized are listed separately at the end of the result; they’re kept as is in the main text, not removed.\nEach reply has a size limit: when a multi-page PDF doesn’t fit, only the first pages are returned, and the end of the reply says which pages parameter to use for the rest; for the full text of the whole document, use ocr_to_file.";
"跟 ocr_image 一样认图片或 PDF，但整份认完写成文件，回复里只给文件路径、页数、字数、用时和每页开头一句。\n适合页数多、要全文的文档：一次最多 100 页（认图时不带插件约 0.8 秒一页，带插件约 1.6 秒；PDF 自带文字的页几十毫秒一页），多的末尾写明接着用什么 pages。\n文件里每页的写法跟 ocr_image 的回复一样；detail=full 时另写一份同名的 .json。\n默认写到 ~/Library/Caches/shizi/results/（下次往那里写的时候，顺手清掉 7 天前的），要留着就用 outputPath 指定；不会覆盖已有的文件。" = "Recognizes an image or PDF like ocr_image, but recognizes the whole document and writes it to a file; the reply gives only the file path, page count, character count, time taken, and the first line of each page.\nMeant for long documents when you need the full text: up to 100 pages per call (recognizing from the image takes about 0.8 s per page without plugins and about 1.6 s with them; PDF pages with their own text take a few dozen milliseconds each); for more, the end of the reply says which pages value to use next.\nEach page in the file is written the same way as in an ocr_image reply; with detail=full, a .json with the same name is written too.\nFiles go to ~/Library/Caches/shizi/results/ by default (results there older than 7 days are cleared the next time something is written there); to keep a file, set outputPath. Existing files are never overwritten.";
"在「拾字」认过的照片里按字找照片（照片图库里的截屏、拍的文件、票据这些）：回文件名、拍摄时间和字里那一段。\n只搜拾字认过的照片，不碰照片图库本身；没认过的照片搜不到，要先在拾字里打开「照片」认一下。" = "Finds photos by their text among the photos Shizi has recognized (screenshots, photographed documents, receipts, and the like in the Photos library): returns the file name, the date taken, and the matching part of the text.\nOnly searches photos Shizi has recognized and never touches the Photos library itself; photos that haven’t been recognized can’t be found, so open Photos in Shizi and recognize them first.";
"图片或 PDF 的路径，可以用 ~" = "Path to the image or PDF; ~ works";
"PDF 页码，如 \"1-3,5\"；默认从头起" = "PDF pages, such as \"1-3,5\"; starts from the first page by default";
"auto（默认）自动选；lines 逐行识别；document 认文档（段落、表格、列表、竖排，要 macOS 26）" = "auto (default) chooses automatically; lines recognizes line by line; document uses document mode (paragraphs, tables, lists, vertical text; requires macOS 26)";
"不给：照拾字设置里的「识别语言」（默认自动判断）。[\"chinese-first\"]：中文优先，汉字夹在字母、数字、算式里也认得准，整页几乎没有汉字或中文认不了的字时自动改回自动判断；[\"auto\"]：系统一行一行自己判断（中文行里字母数字多时汉字可能认成乱码）；[\"zh-Hans\", \"en-US\"]、[\"ja-JP\"] 这样：指定语言，只用第一个语言的模型（中日韩的会排到最前）" = "Omitted: follows the recognition language in Shizi’s settings (automatic by default). [\"chinese-first\"]: Chinese First, which reads Chinese characters accurately even among letters, digits, and formulas, and switches back to automatic when a page has almost no Chinese characters or has characters Chinese recognition can’t read; [\"auto\"]: the system decides line by line on its own (in Chinese lines with many letters and digits, the Chinese characters may come out garbled); a list such as [\"zh-Hans\", \"en-US\"] or [\"ja-JP\"]: sets the languages, and only the first language’s model is used (Chinese, Japanese, and Korean are moved to the front)";
"只认图里这一块：[左, 上, 宽, 高]，0–1，左上角为原点；结果坐标仍相对整张图" = "Recognize only this area of the image: [left, top, width, height], from 0 to 1, with the origin at the top left; result coordinates stay relative to the whole image";
"拉正拍歪的纸；默认 auto" = "Straighten tilted pages; auto by default";
"大图小字切块细认；默认 auto" = "Split large images into tiles to read small text; auto by default";
"找不找二维码 / 条码，默认找" = "Whether to look for QR codes / barcodes; on by default";
"text（默认）只给文字；full 另附一块 JSON：每行位置、可信度、表格格子等（没有 quad 的行是正的，四角就是 box 的四角）" = "text (default) returns just the text; full adds a JSON block with each line’s position, confidence, table cells, and more (lines without a quad are upright, so their four corners are the corners of box)";
"这次调不调判定插件，默认调（没配就没有）" = "Whether to call judgment plugins this time; on by default (has no effect if none are configured)";
"PDF 里有文字时直接用，默认 true：Word、浏览器导出的 PDF 一字不差、快得多，里面的图片另外认；扫描件、别的软件加的隐形文字层、乱码的照样认图。false 就全部认图（mode=document 时也不用）" = "Use a PDF’s own text when it has one; true by default: PDFs exported from Word or a browser come out exact and much faster, and the images inside are recognized separately; scans, invisible text layers added by other software, and garbled text layers are still recognized from the image. false recognizes everything from the image (the text layer is also not used with mode=document)";
"写到哪：以 .md 结尾的绝对路径（可以用 ~），或者一个已有的文件夹（在里面按「源文件名-时间」起名）；不给就写到缓存文件夹" = "Where to write: an absolute path ending in .md (~ works), or an existing folder (the file inside it is named \"source file name-time\"); if omitted, the file goes to the cache folder";
