"用 macOS 自带的文字识别读图片或 PDF 里的字，全在本机。要认图里的字就调 ocr_image；页数多、要整份全文就调 ocr_to_file（写成文件，回复只给路径和摘要）；想知道这台机器能认哪些、插件通不通，调 ocr_status。" = "Reads the text in images or PDFs with macOS’s built-in text recognition, entirely on this Mac. To recognize the text in an image, call ocr_image; for long documents where you need the whole text, call ocr_to_file (it writes a file, and the reply gives only the path and a summary); to find out what this Mac can recognize and whether plugins are reachable, call ocr_status.";

/* CLI.swift */
"用法：\n  shizi-mcp                       作为 MCP 服务运行（标准输入输出）\n  shizi-mcp ocr <图片或PDF> [选项]    在命令行里认一张图\n  shizi-mcp status                看系统能力和插件状况\n  shizi-mcp --version             版本号\n\nocr 的选项：\n  --mode auto|lines|document      默认 auto\n  --lang auto|chinese-first|zh-Hans,en-US,...\n                                  默认照配置（拾字设置里的「识别语言」），没配就是自动判断\n  --pages 1-3,5                   PDF 页码，默认前 20 页\n  --region 左,上,宽,高             只认这一块（0–1，左上为原点）\n  --rectify auto|on|off           拉正拍歪的纸，默认 auto\n  --tiles auto|on|off             大图小字切块细认，默认 auto\n  --no-barcodes                   不找二维码 / 条码（默认找）\n  --no-plugins                    这次不调插件\n  --no-text-layer                 PDF 也全部认图，不用它自带的文字\n  --json                          输出完整的结构化结果\n\n插件配置：~/.config/shizi/config.json（或环境变量 SHIZI_CONFIG），见 docs/plugins.zh-CN.md。" = "Usage:\n  shizi-mcp                       Run as an MCP server (standard input and output)\n  shizi-mcp ocr <file> [options]  Recognize an image or PDF on the command line\n  shizi-mcp status                Show system capabilities and plugin status\n  shizi-mcp --version             Show the version number\n\nOptions for ocr:\n  --mode auto|lines|document      Default: auto\n  --lang auto|chinese-first|zh-Hans,en-US,...\n                                  Default: follows the configuration (Recognition language in Shizi’s settings); automatic if not set\n  --pages 1-3,5                   PDF pages; default: the first 20 pages\n  --region left,top,width,height  Recognize only this area (0–1, origin at the top left)\n  --rectify auto|on|off           Straighten tilted pages; default: auto\n  --tiles auto|on|off             Split large images into tiles to read small text; default: auto\n  --no-barcodes                   Don’t look for QR codes / barcodes (they’re looked for by default)\n  --no-plugins                    Don’t call plugins this time\n  --no-text-layer                 Recognize PDFs from the image too, without using their own text\n  --json                          Output the full structured result\n\nPlugin configuration: ~/.config/shizi/config.json (or the SHIZI_CONFIG environment variable); see docs/plugins.md.";
